    "title": "Is Starbucks Open or Closed on Easter Sunday 2025?",
    "text": "Is Starbucks open or closed on Easter Sunday 2025? Some people are hoping to get an Easter latte. According to TODAY, some Starbucks locations will be open on Easter Sunday 2025. However, that can vary by location. “Store hours vary by location and stores may occasionally adjust their hours based on business and customer needs,” a Starbucks representative told TODAY. Thus, it’s a good idea to call ahead at your chosen location. According to TODAY, some Starbucks locations may be closed on Easter Sunday 2025 or have shorter hours due to the holiday. There’s no centralized list. However, Starbucks does have a store locator. It allows customers to check a location’s hours and location by putting in a city name or zooming in on a map. To check out the premise that some Starbucks were open, we called a Starbucks in Oconomowoc, WI, not far from the City of Milwaukee. The Starbucks was open, and the worker who answered said the location was holding normal hours on Easter Sunday and that other Starbucks in the area were doing so as well. Customers inside an Starbucks Corp. coffee shop in Hanoi, Vietnam, on Saturday, April 12, 2025.Bloomberg/Getty Images Starbucks being open is somewhat of an anomaly on Easter. Other retailers, such as Target, Costco, and Aldi, are closed on Easter Sunday. Chick-fil-A is closed, but that’s because the company is closed every Sunday. Walmart is open on Easter Sunday, however, at most locations. Most Dunkin’ Donuts locations are open on Easter Sunday, according to USA Today, and McDonald’s restaurants also tend to be open on holidays, including Easter Sunday. About the authorJessica McBride is a trending news, sports, and entertainment reporter for Men's Journal and a national award-winning investigative journalist.",
